:: OC Miller House Twins Bath [nobr]

<<if $OCKaydenBabysit.Active == 1>>
    <<if $OCKaydenBabysit.State == "PreDin" && $Time.after(18)>>
        <<goto"Millers Babysitting Dinner">>
    <<elseif $OCKaydenBabysit.State == "PostDin" && $Time.after(19, 30)>>
        <<goto"Millers Babysitting Bath Time">>
    <<elseif $OCKaydenBabysit.State == "Bath" && $Time.after(20)>>
        <<goto"Millers Babysitting Bath Time Bath Done">>
    <<elseif $OCKaydenBabysit.State == "Sleep" && $Time.after(21)>>
        <<goto"Millers Babysitting Ending">>
    <</if>>
<</if>>

<span style="color:Azure"><big><strong>--The Twin's Bathroom--</strong></big></span><br>
<<set $Location to {
	Name: "The Twin's Bathroom",
    Indoors: 1,
    Safe: 1,
    Nudity: 0,
    Public: 0,
    Environment: "Bathroom",
}>>

You’re standing in the twins' bathroom. Despite the appearance of their bedroom, the bathroom is spotless and organized, except for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Jayden</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Kayden</span>’s toothbrushes lying on the counter, and the dirty clothes bin is overfilled. <br>
<br>

<<if $OCKaydenBabysit.Active == 1 && ["PreDin", "PostDin"].includes($OCKaydenBabysit.State)>>
    <<if $HangOutNeed.Fun < 50>>
        <<set _mouth to "Frown">>
        <<set _eyes to "Sad">>
    <<else>>
        <<set _mouth to "Happy">>
        <<set _eyes to "Normal">>
    <</if>>
    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "OC Kayden",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: _mouth,
                Eyes: _eyes,
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>
    <strong>Kayden: </strong><<include"NPC Hang Out Modifiers">><br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:Azure"><strong>-Actions-</strong></span><br>
    [[Pee (0:02)|OC Miller Pee]] <span style="color:Green">-Bladder</span><br>
    
<</if>>

<<if $LinkTravel == 1>>
<span style="color:Azure"><strong>-Travel-</strong></span><br>
	[[The Twin's Bedroom (0:01)|OC Miller House Twins Room][$Minutes += 1]] <br>
<</if>>
<br>

